        volume: "139 plants; ≈250,000 employees (his own figures)",
        mechanism: "Thousands of live repetitions in front of ordinary audiences taught him what landed and what did not. By the time he ran for office the message was tested.",
        cost: "Years on the road and, eventually, a break with GE when the speeches grew too political.",
        tryit: "Give the same talk to many small audiences and revise it every time. That is how a message gets good.",
